   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Text 3D Flip\n\nEvery letter is a small rotating prism: the letters roll over one after another with a spring, a second identical face coming round to the front.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A short line should get an attention-drawing, tactile roll-over, once or a few times.\n- A title needs a playful 3D accent that ends exactly where it began.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The letters should change into different letters: use slot-machine-roll or caption-split-flap.\n- The text is long: the rolling reads as noise.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Text, default \"Stay curious, stay kind\"\n- font_size (number, 12-240): Font size, default 96\n- color (color): Colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- flip_color (color): Flip colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- direction (enum): Direction, default \"top\"\n- stagger_from (enum): Stagger from, default \"first\"\n- stagger (number, 0-0.3): Stagger, default 0.03\n- stiffness (number, 50-600): Spring stiffness, default 160\n- damping (number, 5-80): Spring damping, default 25\n- flips (number, 1-4): Rolls, default 2\n\nSource: https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Text 3D Flip\n\n  Every letter is a small rotating prism: the letters roll over one after another with a spring, a second identical face coming round to the front.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui/blob/166367b4e31a27f166fd6c2b71d7be290fe0c1bc/apps/www/registry/magicui/text-3d-flip.tsx\n  Changes by usemosio/blocks: the source rolls on hover; this block rolls the line at fixed moments instead.\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) Magic UI\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"text-3d-flip\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"5\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    {\"id\": \"text\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Text\", \"description\": \"The line that rolls over.\", \"default\": \"Stay curious, stay kind\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Maximum text size in pixels. Longer text wraps and shrinks to fit the frame.\", \"default\": 96, \"min\": 12, \"max\": 240, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Colour\", \"description\": \"Colour of the front face.\", \"default\": \"#0a0a0a\"},\n    {\"id\": \"flip_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Flip colour\", \"description\": \"Colour of the face that rolls in.\", \"default\": \"#0a0a0a\"},\n    {\"id\": \"direction\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Direction\", \"description\": \"Which edge the letters roll over.\", \"default\": \"top\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"top\", \"label\": \"Top\"}, {\"value\": \"bottom\", \"label\": \"Bottom\"}, {\"value\": \"right\", \"label\": \"Right\"}, {\"value\": \"left\", \"label\": \"Left\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"stagger_from\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Stagger from\", \"description\": \"Where the roll starts.\", \"default\": \"first\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"first\", \"label\": \"First letter\"}, {\"value\": \"last\", \"label\": \"Last letter\"}, {\"value\": \"center\", \"label\": \"Centre\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"stagger\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Stagger\", \"description\": \"Seconds between neighbouring letters (the source uses 0.05).\", \"default\": 0.03, \"min\": 0, \"max\": 0.3, \"step\": 0.01, \"unit\": \"s\"},\n    {\"id\": \"stiffness\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Spring stiffness\", \"description\": \"Spring stiffness of the roll.\", \"default\": 160, \"min\": 50, \"max\": 600, \"step\": 5},\n    {\"id\": \"damping\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Spring damping\", \"description\": \"Spring damping of the roll.\", \"default\": 25, \"min\": 5, \"max\": 80, \"step\": 1},\n    {\"id\": \"flips\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Rolls\", \"description\": \"How many times the whole line rolls within the block.\", \"default\": 2, \"min\": 1, \"max\": 4, \"step\": 1}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Text 3D Flip</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .t3f-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .t3f-line { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; max-width: 92%; font-family: \"Playfair Display\", Georgia, serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; }\n        .t3f-word { display: inline-flex; }\n        .t3f-space { white-space: pre; }\n        .t3f-char { position: relative; display: inline-block; transform-style: preserve-3d; white-space: pre; }\n        .t3f-face { display: block; white-space: pre; backface-visibility: hidden; -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden; }\n        .t3f-back { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"text-3d-flip\" data-duration=\"5\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"t3f-clip\" class=\"t3f-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"5\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div id=\"t3f-line\" class=\"t3f-line\" role=\"img\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/CustomEase.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars =\n              window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables\n                ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables()\n                : {};\n            function num(value, fallback, min, max) {\n              var n = Number(value);\n              return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(max, Math.max(min, n)) : fallback;\n            }\n            function str(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function col(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function pick(value, options, fallback) {\n              return options.indexOf(String(value)) >= 0 ? String(value) : fallback;\n            }\n            // Shrink an element's font until it fits a share of the frame width.\n            function fit(el, size, share) {\n              el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              var max = Math.max(1, root.clientWidth * share);\n              if (el.scrollWidth > max) {\n                size = Math.max(12, size * (max / el.scrollWidth));\n                el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              }\n              return size;\n            }\n            // A seeded random generator, so every seek draws the same thing.\n            function mulberry32(a) {\n              return function () {\n                a |= 0; a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) | 0;\n                var t = Math.imul(a ^ (a >>> 15), 1 | a);\n                t = (t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), 61 | t)) ^ t;\n                return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;\n              };\n            }\n            function clamp01(x) { return x < 0 ? 0 : x > 1 ? 1 : x; }\n            gsap.registerPlugin(CustomEase);\n            var TAG = \"t3f\";\n            var bezN = 0;\n            function bez(x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n              return CustomEase.create(TAG + \"-\" + bezN++, \"M0,0 C\" + x1 + \",\" + y1 + \" \" + x2 + \",\" + y2 + \" 1,1\");\n            }\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            function finish() {\n              var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"5\");\n              if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n              tl.seek(0);\n              window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n              window.__timelines[\"text-3d-flip\"] = tl;\n            }\n\n            var line = document.getElementById(\"t3f-line\");\n            var text = str(vars.text, \"Stay curious, stay kind\");\n            var frontColor = col(vars.color, \"#0a0a0a\");\n            var backColor = col(vars.flip_color, \"#0a0a0a\");\n            var dir = pick(vars.direction, [\"top\", \"bottom\", \"right\", \"left\"], \"top\");\n            var from = pick(vars.stagger_from, [\"first\", \"last\", \"center\"], \"first\");\n            var stagger = num(vars.stagger, 0.03, 0, 0.3);\n            var flips = Math.round(num(vars.flips, 2, 1, 4));\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"5\");\n            line.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", text);\n            var chars = [];\n            var words = text.split(\" \");\n            words.forEach(function (w, wi) {\n              var word = document.createElement(\"span\");\n              word.className = \"t3f-word\";\n              Array.from(w).forEach(function (ch) {\n                var box = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                box.className = \"t3f-char\";\n                box.id = \"t3f-char-\" + chars.length;\n                box.setAttribute(\"aria-hidden\", \"true\");\n                var f = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                f.className = \"t3f-face t3f-front\";\n                f.textContent = ch;\n                f.style.color = frontColor;\n                var b = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                b.className = \"t3f-face t3f-back\";\n                b.textContent = ch;\n                b.style.color = backColor;\n                box.appendChild(f);\n                box.appendChild(b);\n                word.appendChild(box);\n                chars.push({ box: box, front: f, back: b });\n              });\n              line.appendChild(word);\n              if (wi < words.length - 1) {\n                var sp = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                sp.className = \"t3f-space\";\n                sp.textContent = \" \";\n                line.appendChild(sp);\n              }\n            });\n            fit(line, num(vars.font_size, 96, 12, 240), 0.92);\n            var size = parseFloat(line.style.fontSize);\n            var lh = size * 1.2;\n            var n = chars.length;\n            // Stagger offsets per letter.\n            var offs = chars.map(function (_, i) {\n              if (from === \"last\") return (n - 1 - i) * stagger;\n              if (from === \"center\") return Math.abs(Math.floor(n / 2) - i) * stagger;\n              return i * stagger;\n            });\n            // Damped spring step response (mass 1), sampled until it comes to rest.\n            var k = num(vars.stiffness, 160, 50, 600), c = num(vars.damping, 25, 5, 80);\n            var samples = [0], x = 0, v = 0, dt = 1 / 480;\n            for (var si = 0; si < 480 * 6; si++) {\n              v += (-k * (x - 1) - c * v) * dt;\n              x += v * dt;\n              samples.push(x);\n              if (Math.abs(x - 1) * 90 < 0.5 && Math.abs(v) * 90 < 2) break;\n            }\n            var springDur = (samples.length - 1) * dt;\n            function spring(t) {\n              if (t <= 0) return 0;\n              if (t >= springDur) return 1;\n              var p = t / dt, i0 = Math.floor(p);\n              return samples[i0] + (samples[i0 + 1] - samples[i0]) * (p - i0);\n            }\n            var span = Math.max.apply(null, offs) + springDur;\n            var starts = [];\n            for (var q = 0; q < flips; q++) starts.push(0.4 + q * (span + 0.7));\n            var axisY = dir === \"left\" || dir === \"right\";\n            var sign = dir === \"top\" || dir === \"right\" ? 1 : -1;\n            function layout() {\n              chars.forEach(function (o) {\n                var depth = (axisY ? o.box.offsetWidth : lh) / 2;\n                o.depth = depth;\n                o.front.style.transform = \"translateZ(\" + depth + \"px)\";\n                o.back.style.transform = (axisY ? \"rotateY(\" : \"rotateX(\") + (-sign * 90) + \"deg) translateZ(\" + depth + \"px)\";\n              });\n            }\n            layout();\n            var clock = { t: 0 };\n            function draw(t) {\n              chars.forEach(function (o, i) {\n                var angle = 0;\n                for (var s = 0; s < starts.length; s++) {\n                  var u = t - starts[s] - offs[i];\n                  if (u > 0 && u < springDur) angle = 90 * spring(u);\n                }\n                var d = o.depth;\n                o.box.style.transform = \"translateZ(\" + -d + \"px) \" + (axisY ? \"rotateY(\" : \"rotateX(\") + sign * angle + \"deg)\";\n              });\n            }\n            tl.to(clock, { t: total, duration: total, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.t); } }, 0);\n            draw(0);\n\n            finish();\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
 "sha256": "d6b3d82ab245eb22c1e8f8b911e5f1bf6389bf90ba4448ade5c3fb0bc09e63f9",
